# DeepFaceLab modernization — ignore rules
#
# Phase 0 (IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md section 11): replaces the upstream
# allowlist ignore file (ignore-all + extension whitelist) with an
# explicit blocklist. Files already tracked by Git remain tracked
# regardless of these rules — notably:
#   - doc/*          upstream documentation images
#   - facelib/*.npy  official S3FD/2DFAN/3DFAN/FaceEnhancer extractor weights
#   - .vscode/*      upstream-tracked editor configuration
#
# A new intentional repository file of a listed type must be staged
# with `git add -f` and the justification recorded in the commit
# (REVIEW_AND_COMMIT_GUIDE.md section 24).

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Local environments / embedded runtimes ---
# Covers virtualenvs, embedded Python distributions, and the legacy
# bundle's spoofed user-environment directories.
.venv*/
venv*/
env/
_e/
_internal/
python-3*/
Anaconda*/
Miniconda*/

# --- Jupyter ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- DFL working data: datasets and extracted samples ---
workspace/
data_src/
data_dst/
data_xseg/

# --- Generated models and exported artifacts ---
# User checkpoints (official pickle-dict *.npy files, converter
# outputs, merged/exported model files). The four official extractor
# weights in facelib/ remain tracked.
model/
*.npy
*.h5
*.onnx
*.dfm
*.pt
*.pth
*.engine
*.torchscript
pretrained/
pretrain_faces/

# --- Caches ---
.cache/
.nvidia/
nv_cache/
torchinductor/
.pytest-tmp/
*.tmp

# --- Personal media ---
# Tracked upstream images (doc/) are unaffected; intentional new
# repository images must be staged with `git add -f`.
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.mp3
*.wav
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.bmp
*.gif
*.psd
*.tif
*.tiff
*.zip

# --- Logs ---
*.log
logs/

# --- Temporary audit / parity artifacts ---
audit_diffs/
parity_dumps/
*_audit_notes/

# Local/private project planning and audit documents
docs/
